            <ArticleTitle>[Cardiac pain syndrome in women in the climacteric and their personality characteristics].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>66-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The peculiarities of the personality of 125 women in the climacteric period complicated by cardialgia of various intensity were studied. Psychopathological disorders of various severity were found in all women who were examined. With an increase in the intensity of cardialgia, the psychopathologic disorders became more severe.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
